	SERV.LOG [0xa4] Tanimsiz client giris denemesi. [Account=<LOCAL.ACCOUNT>, Hash=<local.hash>] (Num=<DLOCAL.NUM>/22)
	// ARGO.SENDPACKET 026 00 00 00 00 00 
